# tact-agents

Official implementation of **TACT** (*Tacit Agent Coordination via Interaction-specific Training*), from the paper:

> **Do Agents Develop Tacit Understanding? From Repeated Collaboration to Partner-Specific Coordination**
> ICLR 2027

## Overview

TACT studies whether two frozen LLM agents can develop genuine partner-specific coordination knowledge — *Dyadic Tacit Understanding* (DTU) — through repeated collaboration. Each agent maintains a private directional relational state that accumulates across interaction. A lightweight contrastive response model learns to predict the partner's coordination behavior, and distributional guidance is injected into the agent's own context at decision time, without modifying the base LLMs or sharing internal state.

We formalize *Genuine DTU* (GTU) via three jointly-required conditions — **Formation**, **Interaction Specificity**, and **Cross-Instance Generalization** — and test all three using KL-based audit measures under a pre-registered intersection-union procedure.

## Benchmarks

| Benchmark | Task Type |
|---|---|
| Collab-Overcooked | Cross-role handoff coordination |
| Hanabi | Two-player cooperation under information asymmetry |
| CoBlock | Complementary-resource coordination |

Backbones: Claude Sonnet 4.8 · GPT-5.5 · Gemini 3.6 Flash

## Repository Structure

```
tact-agents/
├── envs/               # Benchmark environments
├── tact/               # TACT learner, relational state, guidance injection
├── baselines/          # 7 baseline implementations (B0–B6)
├── audit/              # GTU audit pipeline and KL-based specificity measures
├── scripts/            # Reproduce main results and ablations
└── configs/            # Experiment configurations
```

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<your-org>/tact-agents.git
cd tact-agents
pip install -e .
```

## Quick Start

```bash
# Run TACT on Collab-Overcooked with GPT-5.5
python scripts/run.py --method tact --env overcooked --backbone gpt-5.5

# Run GTU audit
python scripts/audit.py --checkpoint results/overcooked/tact_gpt55/
```

